	)
	(text "Micro switches KFC-W-13W / KFC-C-15A. K: triggered while\nthe key is open (manual_stepper axis_k, ^PA2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2c03c805-ad4c-4908-a71d-ae1acb8bfba6")
	)
	(text "Software I2C on the Aux Pico (gpio4/5), 0x68.\nVCC from the Pico's 3V3: to confirm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.39 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2da8d1ec-1847-4c88-8f37-78dcd18755cc")
	)
	(text "5 V + GND + the ID + USB (12 V stays motion-only). The ID: read\nand later the link, on the plot bed board; the 5 V switched on the\nhub board; USB: the hub's DN2 (CAT6 #2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "39e70d2e-c051-473b-a7ff-39070fd5ebd7")
	)
	(text "Z and K: 4 wires each in silicone ribbons, from the Melzi's\nX and Z ports (sheet Melzi), drivers at ~7.5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "57d72976-90fb-432e-bfbf-42d94a471476")
	)
	(text "Our adapter: a GND between VOUT and VCLK, short runs away from the\nstepper wires, decoupling on VDD at the sensor, never hot-plugged.\nLight: two fibers on the connector's optical port (an LED, planned)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c1c22e7b-2912-403a-a216-dcf9a246cd42")
	)
	(text "Planned: the tool coupling (docs/block-diagrams.md)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 237.49 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e3b5d648-bdb5-42a9-9abe-9d95f13209bc")
	)
	(text "- Z motor (4), K motor (4): silicone ribbons.  - A USB-C cable: the endoscope.\n- A ribbon: the Y, Z and K endstops, the MPU9250 (I2C), the BLTouch (5), 5 V / 3V3 and GND.\n- Mostly 26 AWG (~0.134 ohm/m), a short 30 AWG piece. On 5 V the drop counts twice (GND too).\n- The harness's connector pins, as the Excalidraw drawing has them: 1 3V3/5V, 4 stepper Z, 5 limit Z,\n  6 limit Y, 7 5V, 8 GND; tool side: 1 3V3/5V, 5 stepper K, 6 GND, 7 switch, 8 1-Wire. To fill in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e7f3cfcb-08bb-4ff3-9339-ae075bc579d6")
	)
